[h2]Overview[/h2]
[b]Anbennar - Proper 2K UI[/b] is a patch that makes [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails?id=3290499798]Proper 2K UI Enhanced[/url] work with [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails?id=1385440355]Anbennar[/url].

In short: Anbennar likes breaking UI mods, Proper 2K UI likes making EU4 readable, and this mod forces them to get along.
[img]https://i.imgur.com/Uf8Z21n.png[/img]
[h2]Required Mods[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails?id=1385440355]Anbennar[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails?id=3290499798]Proper 2K UI Enhanced[/url]
[/list]
[img]https://i.imgur.com/Uf8Z21n.png[/img]
